# Lint cache
.eslintcache

# NOT ignored: build/
#
# It reads like output and is not — it is electron-builder's buildResources
# directory, holding the app icon, the macOS entitlements and the afterSign
# hook that signs the app ad-hoc. Ignoring it meant a clone could not produce
# a working build at all, which nobody noticed while every release was made on
# the one machine that happened to have the files. Output goes to dist/.
